        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Horse dung and waste wood chips, at farm
Mixture horse dung (67%) and waste wood (33%);
UUID: f7bdc2c0-78c6-383a-b8c6-1cd4b761556f
This data set includes the wood chips. Horse dung as a waste is assumed to be used with zero burden from its production.
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: Preparation of fuel for grate firing 500-600 kW
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f7bdc2c0-78c6-383a-b8c6-1cd4b761556f.xml</text>
